   "sourceHash": "d365753d86b28d358afe3c2cef58ff48fd6e876882684ee410f48b8a7c37d9a0",
   "text": "治疗师为患者的手部和前臂按摩温热药油",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_9bf3c25576179d98fc98",
   "sourceHash": "9bf3c25576179d98fc982b44d12110b36d5855b8e65bc80a13a9643bc94a8c9f",
   "text": "Kairali 治疗师为一位躺在木制治疗床上的患者按摩前额和太阳穴，涂抹温热药油，身旁放着一只盛油的小铜碗",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
